# Wrangler
.wrangler

# Pet animation pipeline — only the scripts and their README are versioned.
#
# `source/` holds the raw generations, `alpha/` the transparent intermediate
# (rebuildable from `source/`), `normalized/` the 2160x1215 masters. All three
# are tens of megabytes and none of them is what the app serves, so they stay
# on disk and out of git. The one thing that ships lives in `public/pet/`.
pet-assets/source/
pet-assets/alpha/
pet-assets/normalized/
pet-assets/playback/
